{
  "dom_id": "step-q124551",
  "name": "Question 7",
  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14273134/assets/2464c37e0595ae5f3c9863b9fb9858dfa2335ef41f9dd5471d52c559b82d13ba.png)\n\nConsider the rectangle $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, given by\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 2,\\,0\\le v\\le 1\\}.\n$$\n\nThe transformation $T$ is defined as\n\n$$\nx=u+v-1,\\,y=v-u+1.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following gives the image of $Δ$ in the $xy$-plane under the action of $T?$",
